{"id":"dusha","lemma":"душа","pos":"noun","rank":990,"glosses":["soul","spirit","darling"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/Ru-%D0%B4%D1%83%D1%88%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D1%83%D1%88%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"души","plural":"души"},"examples":[{"text":"Твоя душа принадлежит мне.","en":"Your soul belongs to me.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null,{"g":"to belong","l":"принадлежать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Ни одна душа об этом не знает.","en":"Not a single soul knows about it.","words":[{"g":"not a"},null,null,{"g":"about"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Вы думаете, у животных есть душа?","en":"Do you think animals have souls?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"at / by"},null,{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]},{"text":"Я только вышел из душа.","en":"I just got out of the shower.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},{"g":"from / out of"},null]},{"text":"Его душа была в раю.","en":"His soul was in heaven.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"paradise, heaven","l":"рай"}]}]}